                                "example_id": "2c46111b-a71d-457b-ad78-98b7f59bbdcc",
                                "sense_id": "7d02cdfb-8bc1-342a-bc58-e4bdd4a5abdf",
                                "text": "\"I can't leave you here alone with these cutthroats, and you certainly can't venture into the jungle with me; yet someone must go in search of your father. He is more than apt to wandering off aimlessly, regardless of danger or direction, and Mr. Philander is only a trifle less impractical than he. ..."
                            }
